# This file documents the iOS build configuration fixes needed

## Issue: google_fonts FontWeight constant evaluation error
## Solution: Update to google_fonts ^8.0.0 or higher

## Issue: Deployment target warnings
## Solution: Set minimum iOS deployment target to 12.0 in Podfile

## Issue: file_picker deprecated API warnings
## Solution: These are warnings only, won't prevent build. Will be fixed in future file_picker updates.
